WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.140
Social organizations do enormous work in the field.

2
00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:11.250
But the data gets lost between paper forms, Excel versions and endless month-end closings.

3
00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:18.880
TecnoRestart MEAL connects the whole cycle: from field registration to the donor report, with the evidence behind every number.

4
00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.510
Let’s see it in action.

